'''Porygon-Z''' (Japanese: '''ポリゴンＺ''' ''Porygon-Z'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

