==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Porygon-Z|118}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*'''Slowing Beam''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Porygon-Z|66}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

